title: Rack3B
---
// Talk target of the drying rack in 3B (Hotspots layer). See drawers_3b.yarn.
-> Hang the blush socks up <<if $chapter == "R1Sunday" and not $gate_r1_sun_croissant and ($r1_socks_at == "drawers" or $r1_socks_at == "box")>>
    <<set $r1_socks_at to "rack">>
    // PLACEHOLDER line.
    You: There. In the wash. Technically.
-> Put the blush socks on <<if $chapter == "R1Thu2" and not $gate_r1_thu2_door and $r1_socks_at == "rack">>
    <<set $r1_socks_at to "feet">>
    You: Fine. Blush.
-> Take the blush socks <<if $chapter == "R1Thu2" and not $gate_r1_thu2_door and $r1_socks_at == "rack">>
    <<set $r1_socks_at to "">>
    <<set $item_blush_socks to true>>
-> Look
    <<if $r1_socks_at == "rack">>
        You: Blush. Still on the rack. So they were in the wash. Eventually.
        <<if $chapter == "R1Thu2" and not $gate_r1_thu2_door>>
            <<set $r1_thu2_socks_noted to true>>
            <<note thu2_socks "The socks?">>
        <<endif>>
    <<else>>
        You: Two T-shirts and a towel. Drying since Sunday.
    <<endif>>
===
